# NexusCode rules — natural-language constraints injected into the agent's system prompt.
# Lines starting with '#' are comments. Add or edit freely.

- Always use TypeScript strict mode.
- Do not introduce new dependencies without approval.
- Prefer small, focused changes; avoid drive-by refactors.
- Always update tests when behavior changes.
- Never edit generated files.
- Preserve existing code style and import order.
- Do not expose secrets or write them to disk or stdout.
